==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l/en|anæsthetic}}
* {{l/en|anesthetic}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/æn.əs.ˈθɛ.tɪk/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛtɪk|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{label|en|British spelling}} Of, relating to, or causing [[anaesthesia]].

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|British spelling}} A [[substance]] that causes [[reversible]] loss of [[sensation]] or loss of [[consciousness]]; used to perform [[surgery]] without [[pain]].

